{"availability":"available","full":"divya03116/prahari","name":"prahari","description":"PRAHARI - industrial safety reporting, AI hazard and PPE monitoring, corrective-action tracking","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-23T12:44:45Z","updated":"2026-10-09T17:39:09Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://prahari-silk.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://prahari-silk.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:51.654Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:51.654Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:51.654Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:28.871Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T19:34:51.654Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SIF precursor intelligence for process industries.","PRAHARI reads unsafe-act, unsafe-condition and near-miss reports and scores their serious-injury and fatality (SIF) potential from 0 to 100 — what the event could have become, not the injury it happened to record. A near miss that ends with “nobody was hurt” is scored on the hazardous energy, the failed control and the person in the line of fire, never lowered by the lucky outcome.","It is a full-stack application: a React + TypeScript console, a Cloud Functions service layer, and Firebase Auth, Firestore and Storage. Nothing in the product is mocked."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/divya03116/prahari/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1b7063fd1399f310ca78552ec5375bf2ce3d9b229ebce6e76a9e4ff9a97e75d9","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:51.741Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:51.741Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SIF precursor intelligence for process industries.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/divya03116/prahari/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Routes from earlier versions (/login, /triage, /submit, /heat, /actions, /admin, /report/:id) redirect to their new homes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/divya03116/prahari/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"The interface is available in English, Hindi, Assamese and Bengali; the switcher is on the sign-in screen, in the menu and in Settings, and the choice is remembered on the device. src/i18n/en.ts is the source of truth: the other three dictionaries are typed against it, so a missing string is a compile error, and each is downloaded only when chosen.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/divya03116/prahari/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"1b7063fd1399f310ca78552ec5375bf2ce3d9b229ebce6e76a9e4ff9a97e75d9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/divya03116/prahari/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:51.742Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T17:39:09Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/divya03116/prahari/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:51.744Z","hash":"1b7063fd1399f310ca78552ec5375bf2ce3d9b229ebce6e76a9e4ff9a97e75d9","originalBytes":49763,"storedBytes":49763,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["report","only","ppe","camera","app","service","functions","run","tier","npm","email","firebase","reports","admin","model","rules","actions","test","firestore","phone","incident","installation","browser","hazard","never","own","same","their","every","inference","role","site","storage","verified","worker","first","person","vite","what","alert","page","server","text","auth","engine","live","whatsapp","photo","prahari","settings","status","when","audit","build","each","evidence","one","unsafe","action","default","once","shared","src","alerts","frames","open","per","read","see","token","callables","claim","emulator","emulators","models","monitoring","people","project","readme.md","space","url","voice","add","apple","configured","cooldown","filed","fire","frame","indexes","must","number","password","reference","reviewer","rule","score","sent","set","sig